# Local HTML reports and analyses live in docs/ and stay out of the repo — but
# docs/user_manual is the exception: gradle/typst.gradle compiles it into
# assets/usermanual.pdf during the official ATAK release build, so it must be in
# the repo and in the TPP submission zip. It was ignored until v3.1.1, which is
# why every TPP build logged "No *.typ file found, will not build a user manual".
#
# Note the pattern: `docs/*` not `docs/`. Git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so excluding the *contents* is what allows the
# negation below to work.
docs/*
!docs/user_manual/
# Generated reports (can be regenerated)
reports/
